    "name": "Pipkin",
    "steam_appid": 1915520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915520/extras/d8cc4f484108038c5c9cb9a53e36cea8.avif?t=1754446758\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Cute and Spooky Creature Collecting Game with a Fall / Halloween Aesthetic</strong>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> An In-Depth Battle System:</strong>\u00a0with ~250 moves, 15 elemental types, and 4 classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Explore Unique and Colorful Areas:</strong> Explore moonlit forests, a witch academy, a fairytale town where people live in giant pumpkins, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create Your Own Character:</strong> Set your character's appearance, as well as their class and elemental type, giving every character a unique move-set and role in battles.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> A Grind-Free RPG Experience:</strong> Experience and character progression are designed to minimize grinding and cut bloat content out of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> 10+ Hours of Gameplay:</strong> (Demo playtime: ~1 hour)  </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915520/extras/d8cc4f484108038c5c9cb9a53e36cea8.avif?t=1754446758\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Cute and Spooky Creature Collecting Game with a Fall / Halloween Aesthetic</strong>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> An In-Depth Battle System:</strong>\u00a0with ~250 moves, 15 elemental types, and 4 classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Explore Unique and Colorful Areas:</strong> Explore moonlit forests, a witch academy, a fairytale town where people live in giant pumpkins, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create Your Own Character:</strong> Set your character's appearance, as well as their class and elemental type, giving every character a unique move-set and role in battles.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> A Grind-Free RPG Experience:</strong> Experience and character progression are designed to minimize grinding and cut bloat content out of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> 10+ Hours of Gameplay:</strong> (Demo playtime: ~1 hour)  </p></li></ul>",
